{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pasta House Simulator,<strong>\u00a0</strong>delivers a fun yet chaotic kitchen management experience, whether you play solo or with friends in multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients from the market, cook your pasta, prepare the sauce, serve the dish, give the right change, and keep up with your customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/46f4a0536c3a5733809ac485a7be2b15.poster.avif?t=1760971124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/46f4a0536c3a5733809ac485a7be2b15.webm?t=1760971124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/46f4a0536c3a5733809ac485a7be2b15.mp4?t=1760971124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the phone rings, rush to deliver orders, upgrade your kitchen, hire waiters and couriers, and run your very own pasta house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/60cce994fb320e76559e4e539bc9e779.poster.avif?t=1760971124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/60cce994fb320e76559e4e539bc9e779.webm?t=1760971124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/60cce994fb320e76559e4e539bc9e779.mp4?t=1760971124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware! Not every customer comes just to order food. Sometimes you\u2019ll face surprises that will shock you, mess up your routine, or completely transform your restaurant!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883270?t=1760971124","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883270?t=1760971124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/4d29616a48bb4a4e677745f17448cc9c8c927765/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760971124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/4d29616a48bb4a4e677745f17448cc9c8c927765/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760971124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pasta House Simulator,<strong>\u00a0</strong>delivers a fun yet chaotic kitchen management experience, whether you play solo or with friends in multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients from the market, cook your pasta, prepare the sauce, serve the dish, give the right change, and keep up with your customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/46f4a0536c3a5733809ac485a7be2b15.poster.avif?t=1760971124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/46f4a0536c3a5733809ac485a7be2b15.webm?t=1760971124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/46f4a0536c3a5733809ac485a7be2b15.mp4?t=1760971124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the phone rings, rush to deliver orders, upgrade your kitchen, hire waiters and couriers, and run your very own pasta house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/60cce994fb320e76559e4e539bc9e779.poster.avif?t=1760971124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/60cce994fb320e76559e4e539bc9e779.webm?t=1760971124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/extras/60cce994fb320e76559e4e539bc9e779.mp4?t=1760971124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware! Not every customer comes just to order food. Sometimes you\u2019ll face surprises that will shock you, mess up your routine, or completely transform your restaurant!</p>","developers":["Unimy Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/e24c589e40dfe1fcbfe608fadffd2b170aad1fe7/header.jpg?t=1760971124","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"End User License Agreement (EULA)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDate: 28.08.2025<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis End User License Agreement (\"Agreement\") is made between Unimy Studios (\"Licensor\") and the user (\"Licensee\") for Pasta House Smilation (\"Software\"). By downloading, installing, or using the Software, you agree to the terms of this Agreement. If you do not agree, do not use the Software.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. Grant of License<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLicensor grants you the following rights:<br />\r\n<br />